{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>אל</b> [<i>do not</i>], <b>ריבך</b> [<i>your dispute</i>], <b>פן</b> [<i>lest</i>], <b>תפוחי</b> [<i>apples of</i>], <b>נזם</b> [<i>ring</i>] — [verses] 8–12 [i.e.] 'joined ones'." "<b>מה תעשה</b> — at the end of the quarrel, should your fellow shame you and expose you, what will you do? But <b>ריב שלך ריב עם רעך</b> [<i>argue your argument with your fellow</i>] [means] the quarrel that is yours [is] a quarrel with your fellow."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:36.926791939Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}